    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your reckless streak and hunger for thrills led you to the Crucible Keepers, an organization devoted to studying natural and magical disasters. Whether shaping molten glass or charging into the eye of a hurricane, you are at your best when catastrophe is only a few steps away.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Strength, Constitution, Intelligence</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.VG3UdbTmjxulFV2y]{Arcane Overload}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Athletics and Nature</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulGlassblowe]{Glassblower's Tools}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulGlassblowe]{Glassblower's Tools}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBackpack000]{Backpack}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagRope0000000]{Rope}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, 15 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
